{L"费用为估算值，不等同于订阅账单。未记录的模型与费用保持未知。", L"Costs are estimates, not subscription bills. Unrecorded models and costs stay unknown."},
{L"需要包含真实用量的授权导出；普通聊天导出不提供 Token。", L"Needs an authorized export with real usage; plain chat exports contain no tokens."},
{L"本地 JSONL，自动增量读取。", L"Local JSONL, read incrementally."},
{L"本地 JSONL，自动去重读取。", L"Local JSONL, read with deduplication."},
{L"读取同步缓存或 Dashboard CSV；可手动授权同步真实用量，不把 Credits 换算为 Token。", L"Reads the sync cache or a Dashboard CSV; real usage can be synced with manual authorization. Credits are never converted to tokens."},
{L"OTel 逐请求 chat / inference 与 assistant.usage；忽略 agent/session 汇总。", L"OTel per-request chat / inference and assistant.usage; agent/session summaries are ignored."},
{L"国际版 TRAE IDE / SOLO 支持手动授权同步或读取已有用量缓存；CN 需真实用量导出。", L"International TRAE IDE / SOLO supports manual authorized sync or reading an existing usage cache; CN needs a real usage export."},
{L"TraeWork 是独立产品，Code 是其工作模式之一；当前需真实 Token 导出，不直连账号。", L"TraeWork is a separate product and Code is one of its modes; it currently needs a real token export and has no account connection."},
{L"需真实 Token 导出；任务积分不换算为 Token。", L"Needs a real token export; task credits are not converted to tokens."},
{L"需研究任务实际 usage 导出；不按文本长度推测。", L"Needs an actual usage export of research tasks; nothing is guessed from text length."},
{L"需实际用量导出；与 Kimi Code CLI 独立归属。", L"Needs an actual usage export; counted separately from Kimi Code CLI."},
{L"需实际模型调用用量导出，不从当前配置猜历史模型。", L"Needs an export of actual model-call usage; historical models are not guessed from the current configuration."},
{L"仅文本 Token；图像、视频计费单位不换算。", L"Text tokens only; image and video billing units are not converted."},
{L"支持工作流 history Token 总量；分项未知时保留未分类。", L"Supports workflow history token totals; unknown breakdowns stay unclassified."},
{L"导入 message_end usage 或 workflow_finished；不叠加父子总量。", L"Imports message_end usage or workflow_finished; parent and child totals are not added together."},
{L"需模型调用 usage 导出；执行次数不当作 Token。", L"Needs a model-call usage export; execution counts are not treated as tokens."},
{L"导入实际模型响应 usage / 规范用量记录。", L"Imports actual model response usage / normalized usage records."},
{L"导入带调用身份和时间的 response usage；不读取凭据。", L"Imports response usage with call identity and time; credentials are not read."},
{L"读取 providerData.rawUsage；积分不作为 Token 或金额。", L"Reads providerData.rawUsage; credits are not treated as tokens or money."},
{L"读取压缩会话，优先 v4，模型来自请求上下文。", L"Reads compressed sessions, preferring v4; models come from the request context."},
{L"只读 SQLite / 旧消息 JSON。", L"Read-only SQLite / legacy message JSON."},
{L"兼容经验证的本地消息用量；无日志时需要导出。", L"Compatible with verified local message usage; an export is needed when there are no logs."},
{L"只读含 Token 的会话；当前缓存可能没有可计量字段。", L"Read-only sessions containing tokens; the current cache may have no measurable fields."},
{L"读取 projects / 旧 tmp chats JSONL 的 usageMetadata。", L"Reads usageMetadata from projects / legacy tmp chats JSONL."},
{L"新版 usage.record 与旧版 StatusUpdate；实际模型来自同一日志的请求，缺少时保留未知。", L"New usage.record and legacy StatusUpdate; the actual model comes from requests in the same log and stays unknown when missing."},
{L"支持 chats JSONL 与旧版会话 JSON。", L"Supports chats JSONL and legacy session JSON."},
{L"读取 usageLedger.events 的逐请求时间与实际用量；不从消息位置伪造日期。", L"Reads per-request time and actual usage from usageLedger.events; dates are never inferred from message position."},
{L"只读已有同步缓存；不连接运行中的 IDE 或触发同步。", L"Read-only existing sync cache; never connects to a running IDE or triggers a sync."},
{L"只读生成记录；仅接受实际逐次时间，不按会话开始或文件修改时间分摊。", L"Read-only generation records; only real per-call times are accepted, nothing is spread by session start or file modification time."},
{L"读取 IDE API 请求和 CLI metrics；分别按实际保存格式处理缓存。", L"Reads IDE API requests and CLI metrics; caches are handled per actual stored format."},
{L"读取 ui_messages.json；总输入已含缓存，不重复叠加。", L"Reads ui_messages.json; total input already includes cache and is not added twice."},
{L"读取扩展请求用量；与 Kilo CLI 独立统计。", L"Reads extension request usage; counted separately from Kilo CLI."},
{L"只读 OpenCode 兼容 message 表的真实逐请求用量。", L"Read-only real per-request usage from OpenCode-compatible message tables."},
{L"只读 OpenCode 兼容数据库；不另计 Orca 沙箱副本。", L"Read-only OpenCode-compatible database; Orca sandbox copies are not counted again."},
{L"读取带调用身份、真实时间和实际 Token 的消息，不计 Credits。", L"Reads messages with call identity, real time and actual tokens; credits are not counted."},
{L"只统计 v3 usage；不按文本长度估算，历史真实调用在 rewind 后仍计入消耗。", L"Counts v3 usage only; nothing is estimated from text length, and real historical calls still count after a rewind."},
{L"读取逐请求 stats；跳过 turn 标记和会话正文。", L"Reads per-request stats; turn markers and conversation text are skipped."},
{L"读取助手消息 usage，真实 ID 跨副本去重；兼容 OMP 目录。", L"Reads assistant message usage, deduplicating real IDs across copies; compatible with OMP directories."},
{L"读取 JSONL / transcript_events；Codex harness 镜像不完整时需导入原始 Codex 日志。", L"Reads JSONL / transcript_events; import the original Codex logs when the Codex harness mirror is incomplete."},
{L"读取 LlmResponseMetadataEvent 真实用量；无逐次时间时不估日期。", L"Reads real usage from LlmResponseMetadataEvent; dates are not estimated without per-call times."},
{L"只统计 inference_done 逐调用用量；旧上下文快照不视为消耗。", L"Counts per-call inference_done usage only; old context snapshots are not treated as consumption."},
{L"读取 assistant token_usage；会话当前模型不倒推到历史消息。", L"Reads assistant token_usage; the session's current model is not applied to older messages."},
{L"只读 message_nodes 的真实 metrics 和逐次时间。", L"Read-only real metrics and per-call times from message_nodes."},
{L"只读 model_usage；累计或缓存拆分不明时保留未知，不做文本估算。", L"Read-only model_usage; unclear cumulative or cache splits stay unknown and nothing is estimated from text."},
{L"读取真实 llm_response；无时间/身份或缓存口径不明时需规范导出。", L"Reads real llm_response; a normalized export is needed when time/identity or cache semantics are unclear."},
{L"需要实际逐日 Token 导出；本地上下文快照和费用不能当累计 Token。", L"Needs an actual daily token export; local context snapshots and costs cannot be used as cumulative tokens."},
{L"需要含稳定调用 ID 与真实时间的用量导出；ACP 累计快照不按某一天全计。", L"Needs a usage export with stable call IDs and real times; ACP cumulative snapshots are not counted on a single day."},
{L"需要逐请求用量导出；settings 的累计 Token 不按正文比例拆分日期。", L"Needs a per-request usage export; cumulative tokens in settings are not split across dates by text share."},
{L"需要逐调用用量导出；usage-v2 会话累计不假设为同一天。", L"Needs a per-call usage export; usage-v2 session totals are not assumed to belong to one day."},
{L"需要逐请求用量导出；会话累计不按创建时间全计到一天。", L"Needs a per-request usage export; session totals are not all counted on the creation day."},
{L"需要逐请求或逐日用量导出；session_model_usage 累计不伪造调用日期。", L"Needs a per-request or daily usage export; session_model_usage totals do not invent call dates."},
{L"需要实际 Token 导出；不把上下文占比或字符估算当真实用量。", L"Needs an actual token export; context share or character estimates are not treated as real usage."},
{L"需要逐请求用量导出；byModel 累计和 lastRequest 时间不足以还原每日用量。", L"Needs a per-request usage export; byModel totals and lastRequest time cannot reconstruct daily usage."},
{L"需要归属明确的实际用量导出；共享 Claude/Codex/MiMo hook 不重复算为新软件。", L"Needs an actual usage export with clear ownership; the shared Claude/Codex/MiMo hook is not counted again as new software."},
{L"需要真实 Token 导出；requests/spend 不能换算为 Token。", L"Needs a real token export; requests/spend cannot be converted to tokens."},
{L"需要逐请求用量与时间导出；thread 累计不全算到最后更新时间。", L"Needs a per-request usage and time export; thread totals are not all counted at the last update time."},
{L"先在自己的 Cursor 网页登录，按 F12 打开开发者工具，在 Network 的本人用量请求头 Cookie 中复制 WorkosCursorSessionToken 的值，粘贴到下方。不要复制其他 Cookie、账号密码或 API Key。", L"Sign in to your own Cursor account on the web, press F12 to open developer tools, and in Network copy the value of WorkosCursorSessionToken from the Cookie header of your own usage request, then paste it below. Do not copy other cookies, passwords or API keys."},
